        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148297,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que esta função imprimirá no console ao ser chamada?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showScoreTicks\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tick = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; tick &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; tick++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(tick);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showScoreTicks();\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A sequência de números de 0 a 10</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Depende dos valores passados para a função</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O número 0</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A sequência de números de 0 a 10.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148298,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete o código para que a função imprima <code>spawn #</code> três vezes seguido pelos números <code>1</code> até <code>3</code>.<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"spawn\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prefix\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(prefix + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spawnMessage(\" /><text value=\"&quot;spawn #&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>prefix</code> seguido de <code>+</code> e finalmente <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148299,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Multiplique a variável contador por <code>100</code> para números de <code>1</code> a <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"120\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"awardPoints\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"multiplier\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i * multiplier);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"awardPoints(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code> seguido de <code>10</code> e finalmente <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148300,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique os trechos corretos para imprimir <code>Level Up!</code> três vezes.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i = 3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"112\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showMessage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"times\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; times; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level Up!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showMessage(\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>let i = 0;</code> seguido de <code>i &lt; times;</code> e depois <code>i++</code>, <code>\"Level Up!\"</code>, <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148301,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete a declaração do loop para que o contador comece com <code>start</code> e vá até que seja no máximo igual a <code>end</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"70\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnWaves\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"start, end\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wave = start; wave &lt;= end; wave++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Wave &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + wave);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spawnWaves(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>wave = start; wave &lt;= end;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148302,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que a função <code>showHint</code> imprimirá no console?<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showHint\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"text\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showHint(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Press SPACE to jump!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>Hello</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>Pressione SPACE para pular!</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Pressione SPACE para pular!</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148303,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adicione o item <code>'Health Potion'</code> ao array <code>inventory</code> usando a função <code>addItem</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"item\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;inventory&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"127\" /><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"129\" /><option startIndex=\"129\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"142\" endIndex=\"143\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addItem\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"inventory, item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" inventory.push(item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"addItem(inventory, \" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>inventory</code> seguido de <code>,</code> e depois <code>\"</code>, <code>Health Potion</code>, <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148304,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Itere sobre o array <code>damageValues</code> e certifique-se de que cada número dentro dele seja multiplicado por 2.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"length()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"125\" endIndex=\"126\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"doubleDamage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"damageValues\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; damageValues.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  damageValues[i] = damageValues[i] * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"doubleDamage([\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>for</code> seguido de <code>length</code> e depois <code>++</code>, <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148305,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Passe os parâmetros <code>loot</code> e <code>searchItem</code> para a função para procurar no baú e ver se <code>'Health Potion'</code> existe.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Coins&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"298\" endIndex=\"313\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"searchLoot\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"loot, searchItem\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" foundItem = loot.find(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" item === searchItem);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (foundItem) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(searchItem + \" /><text value=\"&quot; found in the chest!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No such item in the chest!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"searchLoot(loot, \" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>loot</code> seguido de <code>searchItem</code> e finalmente <code>\"Health Potion\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148306,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual valor a variável <code>damageTotals</code> terá?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damageTotals = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"combineDamage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"playerHits, enemyArmor\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; playerHits.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = playerHits[i] * enemyArmor[i];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  damageTotals.push(total);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"combineDamage([\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"], [\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(damageTotals);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>[5, 12, 21, 32]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>[6, 8, 10, 12]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>[5, 12, 21, 32]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
